      "source": "Generic Hibernate <code>AbstractJtaPlatform</code> implementation that simply resolves the\nJTA <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/transaction/UserTransaction.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.transaction\"><code>UserTransaction</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/transaction/TransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.transaction\"><code>TransactionManager</code></a> from the Spring-configured\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/jta/JtaTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.jta\"><code>JtaTransactionManager</code></a> implementation.",
